WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:03,253
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,303 --> 00:00:05,412
This is Episode 52.

3
00:00:05,462 --> 00:00:06,606
Morning.

4
00:00:06,656 --> 00:00:08,193
The owl hoots.

5
00:00:08,243 --> 00:00:09,849
The glass rings.

6
00:00:09,899 --> 00:00:11,496
The lamp beeps.

7
00:00:11,546 --> 00:00:13,042
All at once!

8
00:00:13,092 --> 00:00:15,020
Maya covers her ears.

9
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:16,315
Too much.

10
00:00:16,365 --> 00:00:17,520
Oh no!

11
00:00:17,570 --> 00:00:19,457
Here comes the big board.

12
00:00:19,507 --> 00:00:20,833
One board.

13
00:00:20,883 --> 00:00:22,409
Three helpers.

14
00:00:22,459 --> 00:00:24,477
The owl pins a red note.

15
00:00:24,527 --> 00:00:26,736
The glass pins a yellow one.

16
00:00:26,786 --> 00:00:28,935
The lamp pins a green one.

17
00:00:28,985 --> 00:00:30,712
Now Maya can see.

18
00:00:30,762 --> 00:00:32,158
Red first.

19
00:00:32,208 --> 00:00:33,965
That one is urgent.

20
00:00:34,015 --> 00:00:35,521
She fixes it.

21
00:00:35,571 --> 00:00:37,158
Tap tap tap.

22
00:00:37,208 --> 00:00:38,262
Flip!

23
00:00:38,312 --> 00:00:40,029
Red turns green.

24
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:41,414
All green.

25
00:00:41,464 --> 00:00:42,750
All calm.

26
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,125
One board.

27
00:00:44,175 --> 00:00:46,163
Everything in one place.

28
00:00:46,213 --> 00:00:47,609
Red first.

29
00:00:47,659 --> 00:00:49,005
Then yellow.

30
00:00:49,055 --> 00:00:50,390
Then green.

31
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,247
That is the big board.

32
00:00:52,297 --> 00:00:54,406
Now you know Security Hub!

33
00:00:54,456 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
